{"id":"bc06a64193b5ff40","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-degree-splitting.md","title":"Degree Splitting","display":"df-degree-splitting — Degree Splitting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-degree-splitting","aliases":["68-df-degree-splitting"],"display":"df-degree-splitting — Degree Splitting","depends_on":["[[68-df-degree-join]]","[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-degree-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-degree-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-splitting — Degree Splitting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ed6f28789f0aa57\" href=\"?note=4ed6f28789f0aa57\" title=\"68-df-degree-join\">68-df-degree-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，度序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a>，度 join 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ed6f28789f0aa57\" href=\"?note=4ed6f28789f0aa57\" title=\"68-df-degree-join\">68-df-degree-join</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Split}\">\\(\\mathrm{Split}\\)</span> 的参数顺序为两个分支、被分裂的度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf b\\oplus\\mathbf c=\\mathbf a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf b\\oplus\\mathbf c=\\mathbf a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自包含地定义分裂性质；它本身不声称任何非零度都可分裂。Sacks 分裂定理在本批次作为扩展保留，未在给定短书中定位到证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-degree-join","status":"resolved","id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D$，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]。$\\mathrm{Split}$ 的参数顺序为两个分支、被分裂的度。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-join","status":"resolved","id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D$，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]。$\\mathrm{Split}$ 的参数顺序为两个分支、被分裂的度。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Split}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf b<\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c<\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf b\\oplus\\mathbf c=\\mathbf a.","display":true}],"bytes":1179,"backlinks":[{"id":"22650f6ea4564962","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。"},{"id":"3c3856e6a89f9c9b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathrm{Split}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c,\\mathbf a)$ 见 [[68-df-degree-splitting]]，$\\mid$ 见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]，严格度序及零度由这些定义的上游给定。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-splitting]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-splitting]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-splitting|df-degree-splitting — Degree Splitting]]"}],"outgoing":["4ed6f28789f0aa57","52c2209f400df1a9"]}